2) Snort 설치와 확인 
apt-get install -y snort
snort -V

3) Snort 설정 파일
snort -T -c /etc/snort/snort.conf    

snort -i eth0 -c /etc/snort/snort.conf

4) Snort 로그파일 
snort -A console -c /etc/snort/snort.conf

tail -f /var/log/snort/snort.alert.fast

